'''You are not prepared''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete a [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid using only supplies provided by the [[Helpful Spirit]] without dying, at level 150 or above. The task will fail if any players in the raid use outside supplies.

==Strategy==
Players should pre-pot (including with an [[extended anti-venom+]]) before entering the raid. Using a [[Falador shield]] to restore prayer and the [[Keris partisan of the sun]] special attack or [[Blood spells|Blood Spells]] to restore health will not fail the task. Health, prayer, run energy and special attack are also restored after clearing each path.

It is recommended to prioritise taking [[nectar]] and [[tears of Elidinis]] from the [[Helpful Spirit]]. [[Ambrosia]] is also useful as it is the only way to cure poison or venom. Start with [[Zebak]] and [[Kephri]] first since they can be cleared with little damage taken, then take care to avoid the [[Cursed Baboon]]'s venom trails in the [[Path of Apmeken]].

